PART 3: COMPONENTS AND THEIR COVERAGE
================================================================================

The following components are covered by this license:

  - ECHO Governor Indexing Algorithm (A-000 through A-158 and future additions)
  - LHEA (Latin-Hebrew Execution Architecture) specification and implementation
  - TEMA (Toroidal Eigenvalue Memory Architecture) specification and implementation
  - Mashet/Alamaket framework documentation and data
  - Validated Generalization Matrix (VGM) axiom set
  - Logic Reasoning Matrix (LRM) implementation
  - Geosensory Registry and crawler (A-155, A-158)
  - Homework acquisition system (homework.py, run_homework.py)
  - All artifacts, React interfaces, and deployment configurations
  - All matrix exports (JSON data files in the /matrices directory)

